sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Manager as "Manager/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (manager.shift-swap-approvals.show)"
    participant Controller as "ShiftSwapApprovalController"
    participant Model as "ShiftSwapRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Manager->>View: Klik detail tukar shift
    View->>Controller: GET /manager/shift-swap-approvals/{id}
    Controller->>Model: findOrFail(id) + eager load relasi
    Model->>DB: SELECT shift_swap_request + requester + target + shifts + audit_logs
    DB-->>Model: Data detail permintaan
    Model-->>Controller: Entitas swap request

    alt Data valid (id ditemukan & akses departemen valid)
        Controller->>View: Render halaman detail
        View-->>Manager: Detail tukar shift ditampilkan
    else Data tidak valid (id tidak ditemukan/unauthorized)
        Controller->>View: 404/403 atau back + error
        View-->>Manager: Notifikasi gagal melihat detail
    end
